[{"text": "Hello everyone and welcome back to another great lesson with EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.2799999999999996, "end": 6.58}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.92, "end": 7.6}, {"text": "Erika, today we have a great intermediate lesson.", "start": 8.02, "end": 11.2}, {"text": "That's right, we've got a lesson about love.", "start": 11.54, "end": 14.3}, {"text": "About love.", "start": 14.5, "end": 15.32}, {"text": "And about apologizing.", "start": 15.68, "end": 17.1}, {"text": "Ah, okay. Love and apologizing.", "start": 17.24, "end": 19.72}, {"text": "They go together.", "start": 19.88, "end": 20.72}, {"text": "Yes, they do. Especially if you have a girlfriend or boyfriend, right?", "start": 20.9, "end": 23.52}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 23.62, "end": 24.16}, {"text": "Okay, so why don't we start by looking at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 24.9, "end": 29.3}, {"text": "Vocabulary Preview", "start": 30.119999999999997, "end": 31.52}, {"text": "In today's vocabulary preview, we will learn two important words from our dialogue.", "start": 31.52, "end": 39.3}, {"text": "What's the first word?", "start": 39.8, "end": 41.04}, {"text": "Knock over.", "start": 41.42, "end": 42.46}, {"text": "Knock over.", "start": 42.82, "end": 44.42}, {"text": "Knock over.", "start": 44.82, "end": 45.88}, {"text": "Knock over.", "start": 46.08, "end": 47.26}, {"text": "So that's a really simple one. When you knock something over...", "start": 47.64, "end": 50.96}, {"text": "You make it fall down.", "start": 50.96, "end": 52.22}, {"text": "Make it fall down.", "start": 52.38, "end": 53.22}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 53.46, "end": 53.72}, {"text": "Speaking of knocking things over, this morning,", "start": 54.06, "end": 58.0}, {"text": "I knocked over my coffee cup all over my desk.", "start": 58.0, "end": 61.78}, {"text": "Yeah, I saw that. You almost ruined our lesson plan for today.", "start": 62.0, "end": 65.64}, {"text": "Yes, I did. It was all over the place.", "start": 65.82, "end": 68.54}, {"text": "Okay, let's look at our second word.", "start": 69.47999999999999, "end": 71.82}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 72.56, "end": 73.1}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 73.98, "end": 74.0}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 75.12, "end": 75.66}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 76.12, "end": 76.66}, {"text": "", "start": 76.92, "end": 76.92}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 78.3, "end": 78.94}, {"text": "", "start": 79.0, "end": 79.0}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 79.06, "end": 79.34}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 79.34, "end": 79.4}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 79.92, "end": 80.02}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 83.14, "end": 83.78}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 85.04, "end": 85.68}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 87.66, "end": 88.3}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 88.3, "end": 88.36}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 88.36, "end": 88.38}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 88.38, "end": 88.42}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 88.42, "end": 88.88}, {"text": "", "start": 88.88, "end": 88.88}, {"text": "", "start": 88.88, "end": 88.88}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 88.88, "end": 89.26}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 89.34, "end": 89.36}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 89.36, "end": 89.84}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 89.84, "end": 90.14}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 90.36, "end": 91.0}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 91.0, "end": 91.06}, {"text": "", "start": 91.06, "end": 91.06}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 91.06, "end": 91.4}, {"text": "", "start": 91.4, "end": 91.4}, {"text": "", "start": 91.4, "end": 91.4}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 93.68, "end": 94.32}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 97.18, "end": 97.82}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 106.0, "end": 106.64}, {"text": "Explode.", "start": 106.64, "end": 106.76}, {"text": "", "start": 106.84, "end": 106.84}, {"text": "", "start": 106.84, "end": 106.84}, {"text": "What's going on?", "start": 106.84, "end": 108.14}, {"text": "Watch out!", "start": 109.2, "end": 110.0}, {"text": "Hey, watch where you're going.", "start": 115.67999999999999, "end": 117.3}, {"text": "Oh no, I'm so sorry. Are you alright?", "start": 117.66, "end": 120.04}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 121.1, "end": 122.06}, {"text": "I feel terrible. I really didn't mean to knock you over.", "start": 122.32, "end": 125.44}, {"text": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.", "start": 125.64, "end": 127.94}, {"text": "Really, it was an accident.", "start": 128.18, "end": 129.18}, {"text": "Please accept my apologies.", "start": 129.56, "end": 130.8}, {"text": "Just let me try to stand up.", "start": 131.08, "end": 132.48}, {"text": "Why do birds suddenly appear every time you are naked?", "start": 143.24, "end": 153.04}, {"text": "Oh, wait a second. You seem really familiar. I think I know you from somewhere.", "start": 153.24, "end": 158.3}, {"text": "Yeah, that's right. I think we've met somewhere before.", "start": 158.92, "end": 161.3}, {"text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend. What a coincidence.", "start": 161.58, "end": 164.76}, {"text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see you're not badly hurt.", "start": 165.48, "end": 168.02}, {"text": "And I should probably get going. I've got a 9 o'clock meeting.", "start": 168.16, "end": 170.4}, {"text": "But here's my number. Call me and we'll exchange insurance information.", "start": 171.72, "end": 174.68}, {"text": "Ouch! My ankle! I think it's broken.", "start": 175.04, "end": 177.78}, {"text": "You can't just leave me like this.", "start": 178.12, "end": 179.84}, {"text": "Are you calling an ambulance?", "start": 185.94, "end": 187.26}, {"text": "Nope. I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.", "start": 187.98, "end": 191.26}, {"text": "Do you remember when we met?", "start": 191.26, "end": 196.76}, {"text": "Last day, I knew you were my friend.", "start": 198.45999999999998, "end": 202.64}, {"text": "I want to tell you how much I love you.", "start": 203.48, "end": 210.18}, {"text": "I love happy endings.", "start": 216.98000000000002, "end": 219.46}, {"text": "Such a romantic dialogue.", "start": 219.46, "end": 221.56}, {"text": "Yeah, this guy. Oh my God. He is amazing.", "start": 221.94, "end": 224.74}, {"text": "I would love to meet a guy like that.", "start": 224.76, "end": 226.64}, {"text": "Like that? Like crashing into you?", "start": 227.1, "end": 229.2}, {"text": "Maybe not like that.", "start": 229.62, "end": 231.04}, {"text": "Okay, well I think it's time to look at some of the language in this dialogue.", "start": 231.94, "end": 236.1}, {"text": "Let's start with our language takeaway.", "start": 236.46, "end": 239.36}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 241.43999999999997, "end": 242.48}, {"text": "Today, we have three important words from our dialogue that we will learn for our language takeaway.", "start": 243.72, "end": 251.28}, {"text": "The first word is familiar.", "start": 251.7, "end": 254.18}, {"text": "Familiar.", "start": 254.7, "end": 255.36}, {"text": "Familiar.", "start": 255.6, "end": 256.1}, {"text": "Familiar.", "start": 256.68, "end": 257.4}, {"text": "This one I think is a little bit hard to explain.", "start": 257.76, "end": 260.5}, {"text": "Yeah, so let's listen to some examples on how we use familiar.", "start": 260.78, "end": 264.62}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 265.86, "end": 266.94}, {"text": "Norman Clark.", "start": 269.76, "end": 271.06}, {"text": "That name sounds familiar.", "start": 271.48, "end": 272.76}, {"text": "Where have I heard it before?", "start": 273.12, "end": 274.4}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 277.28, "end": 278.3}, {"text": "Do you know where we are?", "start": 281.5, "end": 282.94}, {"text": "I have no idea.", "start": 283.2, "end": 284.6}, {"text": "Nothing looks familiar.", "start": 285.26, "end": 286.14}, {"text": "I think we're lost.", "start": 286.5, "end": 287.38}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 290.46000000000004, "end": 291.58}, {"text": "You look really familiar.", "start": 294.3, "end": 295.74}, {"text": "Did we go to high school together?", "start": 296.08, "end": 297.16}, {"text": "So when something's familiar, you think you know it, but you're not exactly sure.", "start": 300.5, "end": 307.1}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 307.58, "end": 308.26}, {"text": "Familiar.", "start": 308.42, "end": 308.96}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 309.26, "end": 309.56}, {"text": "Our next word is...", "start": 309.94, "end": 312.2}, {"text": "Place.", "start": 312.2, "end": 312.78}, {"text": "Place.", "start": 313.14, "end": 313.82}, {"text": "Place.", "start": 314.26, "end": 314.78}, {"text": "Aaron's place.", "start": 315.4, "end": 316.5}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 317.12, "end": 317.8}, {"text": "So when we refer to place, we refer to house.", "start": 317.8, "end": 321.18}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 321.18, "end": 321.76}, {"text": "So I can say, hey Marco, come over to my place for dinner tonight.", "start": 321.96, "end": 325.7}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 326.1, "end": 326.66}, {"text": "Or I could say, we're having a party at my place tonight at eight.", "start": 326.66, "end": 330.94}, {"text": "You might ask someone, how's your new place?", "start": 331.26, "end": 333.92}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 334.18, "end": 334.58}, {"text": "How's your new apartment?", "start": 334.8, "end": 335.54}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 335.96, "end": 336.38}, {"text": "That's a good one.", "start": 336.38, "end": 337.08}, {"text": "So place.", "start": 337.28, "end": 337.82}, {"text": "It's a house.", "start": 338.06, "end": 339.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 339.46, "end": 339.84}, {"text": "Our final word today is...", "start": 340.38, "end": 342.38}, {"text": "Coincidence.", "start": 343.58, "end": 344.14}, {"text": "Coincidence.", "start": 344.98, "end": 345.54}, {"text": "Coincidence.", "start": 346.12, "end": 346.68}, {"text": "Coincidence.", "start": 347.16, "end": 347.72}, {"text": "Coincidence.", "start": 347.72, "end": 347.88}, {"text": "So again, we have some great examples for you to understand how we use coincidence.", "start": 348.34, "end": 353.52}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 354.74, "end": 355.7}, {"text": "I'm going to New York this weekend.", "start": 357.96, "end": 359.76}, {"text": "What a coincidence.", "start": 360.08, "end": 361.18}, {"text": "I am too.", "start": 361.54, "end": 362.06}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 364.92, "end": 365.84}, {"text": "By coincidence, everyone in the room was named Alex.", "start": 368.18, "end": 371.9}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 376.14000000000004, "end": 376.98}, {"text": "We met by pure coincidence.", "start": 380.0, "end": 381.96}, {"text": "One day we ran into each other on our bikes, and we've been together ever since.", "start": 382.62, "end": 386.04}, {"text": "A coincidence is something that happens by chance, right?", "start": 388.96000000000004, "end": 392.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 392.38, "end": 392.68}, {"text": "You didn't plan it.", "start": 392.76, "end": 393.46}, {"text": "It just happened.", "start": 393.5, "end": 394.14}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 394.36, "end": 394.64}, {"text": "These funny little things happen all the time.", "start": 394.84, "end": 396.58}, {"text": "I love it when these coincidences happen.", "start": 396.58, "end": 399.38}, {"text": "Yeah, they're great.", "start": 400.08, "end": 401.3}, {"text": "So Erica, why don't you tell us about a coincidence that's happened to you?", "start": 401.48, "end": 405.48}, {"text": "Well, the other night I was having dinner in a restaurant, and I looked up and I saw my", "start": 405.84, "end": 413.5}, {"text": "old professor from university.", "start": 413.5, "end": 415.38}, {"text": "It was such a coincidence because here we are in Shanghai, and I see my professor from", "start": 415.68, "end": 421.06}, {"text": "Canada having dinner at the table next to me.", "start": 421.06, "end": 423.88}, {"text": "It was such a coincidence.", "start": 423.98, "end": 425.18}, {"text": "That is a coincidence.", "start": 425.28, "end": 426.32}, {"text": "Or has it ever happened to you that you're thinking of someone and that person calls you?", "start": 426.32, "end": 431.16}, {"text": "That happens all the time.", "start": 431.28, "end": 432.38}, {"text": "That's a coincidence.", "start": 432.96, "end": 433.98}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 434.36, "end": 434.9}, {"text": "Okay, so now that we have learned these three language takeaway words, we can listen to our", "start": 435.66, "end": 441.98}, {"text": "dialogue a second time, but this time it's going to be slower.", "start": 441.98, "end": 445.28}, {"text": "Hey, watch where you're going.", "start": 449.4, "end": 451.82}, {"text": "Oh no, I'm so sorry.", "start": 452.2, "end": 454.32}, {"text": "Are you all right?", "start": 454.7, "end": 455.86}, {"text": "What?", "start": 455.86, "end": 456.0}, {"text": "Oh, I don't know.", "start": 456.78, "end": 458.28}, {"text": "I feel terrible.", "start": 458.82, "end": 460.48}, {"text": "I didn't mean to knock you over.", "start": 460.86, "end": 462.76}, {"text": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.", "start": 463.1, "end": 466.68}, {"text": "Really, it was an accident.", "start": 467.08, "end": 469.04}, {"text": "Please accept my apologies.", "start": 469.54, "end": 470.98}, {"text": "Just let me try to stand up.", "start": 471.58, "end": 473.94}, {"text": "Oh, wait a second.", "start": 474.38, "end": 476.06}, {"text": "You seem really familiar.", "start": 476.44, "end": 478.62}, {"text": "I think I know you from somewhere.", "start": 479.23999999999995, "end": 481.8}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 482.64, "end": 482.94}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 482.94, "end": 483.02}, {"text": "I think we have met somewhere before.", "start": 483.38, "end": 485.7}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 486.64, "end": 487.42}, {"text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend.", "start": 487.42, "end": 490.12}, {"text": "What a coincidence.", "start": 490.56, "end": 491.64}, {"text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see that you're not badly hurt and I should probably get going.", "start": 492.38, "end": 497.56}, {"text": "I have a nine o'clock meeting.", "start": 497.98, "end": 499.84}, {"text": "But here's my number.", "start": 500.54, "end": 501.92}, {"text": "I'll call me and we'll exchange insurance information.", "start": 501.92, "end": 504.84}, {"text": "Ouch.", "start": 505.56, "end": 506.24}, {"text": "My ankle.", "start": 506.58, "end": 507.72}, {"text": "I think it's broken.", "start": 508.02, "end": 509.8}, {"text": "You can't just leave me like this.", "start": 510.24, "end": 513.04}, {"text": "Are you calling an ambulance?", "start": 514.14, "end": 516.18}, {"text": "No.", "start": 516.82, "end": 517.4}, {"text": "I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.", "start": 517.84, "end": 521.54}, {"text": "Well, that was much clearer, wasn't it?", "start": 527.36, "end": 529.5}, {"text": "Yes, that was clearer.", "start": 529.7, "end": 531.2}, {"text": "And this brings us to Fluency Builder.", "start": 531.26, "end": 533.68}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 534.9, "end": 536.02}, {"text": "In today's Fluency Builder, we're going to show you different ways of apologizing.", "start": 536.34, "end": 541.38}, {"text": "It's so important to be able to apologize well and fluently.", "start": 541.38, "end": 547.18}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 547.56, "end": 548.2}, {"text": "And you also want to say something different from I'm sorry.", "start": 548.2, "end": 551.16}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 551.48, "end": 551.8}, {"text": "So that's what we're going to show you today.", "start": 552.14, "end": 553.82}, {"text": "We heard some great expressions for I'm sorry in the dialogue.", "start": 554.04, "end": 558.48}, {"text": "Let's listen now.", "start": 558.74, "end": 559.76}, {"text": "I'm so sorry.", "start": 560.82, "end": 562.08}, {"text": "I feel terrible.", "start": 563.1400000000001, "end": 564.84}, {"text": "Please accept my apologies.", "start": 565.86, "end": 567.46}, {"text": "I'm so sorry.", "start": 571.1800000000001, "end": 572.18}, {"text": "I feel terrible.", "start": 573.5400000000001, "end": 574.94}, {"text": "Please accept my apologies.", "start": 576.22, "end": 577.56}, {"text": "Yeah, I feel terrible.", "start": 578.88, "end": 580.48}, {"text": "I say this one all the time.", "start": 580.64, "end": 582.48}, {"text": "Yeah, it's a great way of saying I'm sorry.", "start": 582.62, "end": 584.16}, {"text": "Now, also, if you want to say I'm sorry, you also want to tell the person that you made a mistake, right?", "start": 584.34, "end": 589.58}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 589.58, "end": 590.44}, {"text": "And we did hear some wonderful expressions for I made a mistake in this dialogue.", "start": 590.44, "end": 595.88}, {"text": "I didn't mean to knock you over.", "start": 597.5400000000001, "end": 598.98}, {"text": "It was an accident.", "start": 600.48, "end": 601.7}, {"text": "I didn't mean to knock you over.", "start": 604.54, "end": 606.56}, {"text": "It was an accident.", "start": 608.06, "end": 609.28}, {"text": "Well, I didn't mean to knock my coffee cup over this morning.", "start": 610.28, "end": 614.2}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 614.62, "end": 615.1}, {"text": "It was an accident.", "start": 615.26, "end": 616.02}, {"text": "It was.", "start": 616.02, "end": 616.6}, {"text": "Not on purpose, right?", "start": 617.46, "end": 618.82}, {"text": "Or so you think.", "start": 618.96, "end": 619.92}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 621.6, "end": 622.08}, {"text": "So all of these phrases are really useful and great for apologizing and telling someone you made a mistake.", "start": 622.52, "end": 628.74}, {"text": "Well, it's time for us to listen to our dialogue a third time.", "start": 629.48, "end": 633.0}, {"text": "This time it'll be at its normal speed, and I think you'll be able to understand a little bit better.", "start": 633.36, "end": 638.2}, {"text": "Whoa!", "start": 643.96, "end": 644.48}, {"text": "What's going on?", "start": 645.12, "end": 646.16}, {"text": "Watch out!", "start": 647.1800000000001, "end": 648.0}, {"text": "Hey!", "start": 653.3000000000001, "end": 653.82}, {"text": "Watch where you're going!", "start": 654.16, "end": 655.32}, {"text": "Oh no!", "start": 655.64, "end": 656.16}, {"text": "I'm so sorry!", "start": 656.36, "end": 657.26}, {"text": "Are you alright?", "start": 657.52, "end": 658.04}, {"text": "I don't know.", "start": 659.08, "end": 660.06}, {"text": "I feel terrible.", "start": 660.28, "end": 661.42}, {"text": "I really didn't mean to knock you over.", "start": 661.68, "end": 663.46}, {"text": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.", "start": 663.66, "end": 665.94}, {"text": "Really, it was an accident.", "start": 666.18, "end": 667.18}, {"text": "Please accept my apologies.", "start": 667.18, "end": 668.82}, {"text": "Just let me try to stand up.", "start": 669.2, "end": 670.5}, {"text": "Why do birds suddenly appear?", "start": 680.32, "end": 686.14}, {"text": "Every time you are naked...", "start": 687.66, "end": 691.34}, {"text": "Oh, wait a second.", "start": 691.34, "end": 692.84}, {"text": "You seem really familiar.", "start": 693.14, "end": 694.48}, {"text": "I think I know you from somewhere.", "start": 694.5, "end": 696.3}, {"text": "Yeah, that's right.", "start": 697.14, "end": 697.96}, {"text": "I think we've met somewhere before.", "start": 698.12, "end": 699.32}, {"text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend.", "start": 699.66, "end": 701.42}, {"text": "What a coincidence.", "start": 701.74, "end": 702.78}, {"text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see you're not badly hurt, and I should probably get going.", "start": 703.46, "end": 707.2}, {"text": "I've got a nine o'clock meeting.", "start": 707.2, "end": 708.42}, {"text": "But here's my number.", "start": 709.64, "end": 710.66}, {"text": "I'll call me.", "start": 711.0, "end": 711.28}, {"text": "I'll call me.", "start": 711.38, "end": 711.8}, {"text": "I'll exchange insurance information.", "start": 711.8, "end": 712.74}, {"text": "Ouch!", "start": 713.06, "end": 713.48}, {"text": "My ankle!", "start": 713.72, "end": 714.62}, {"text": "I think it's broken.", "start": 714.9, "end": 715.78}, {"text": "You can't just leave me like this!", "start": 716.16, "end": 717.88}, {"text": "Are you calling an ambulance?", "start": 723.86, "end": 725.28}, {"text": "Nope.", "start": 725.96, "end": 726.44}, {"text": "I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.", "start": 726.78, "end": 729.32}, {"text": "Do you remember when we met?", "start": 729.32, "end": 734.78}, {"text": "Last day, I knew you were my friend.", "start": 736.08, "end": 740.62}, {"text": "I want to tell you how much I love you.", "start": 741.48, "end": 748.24}, {"text": "Great dialogue and great music, right?", "start": 753.04, "end": 755.52}, {"text": "Wonderful music.", "start": 755.74, "end": 756.76}, {"text": "Who picked that, Marco?", "start": 756.76, "end": 757.84}, {"text": "Of course, me.", "start": 757.84, "end": 759.3}, {"text": "I'm a romantic type.", "start": 759.58, "end": 760.94}, {"text": "I love romantic music.", "start": 761.08, "end": 762.12}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 762.3, "end": 762.52}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 762.92, "end": 763.44}, {"text": "Well, speaking of a romantic type, do you believe in love at first sight?", "start": 763.96, "end": 769.24}, {"text": "I kind of do.", "start": 770.22, "end": 771.76}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 772.06, "end": 772.24}, {"text": "I'd like to believe it.", "start": 772.24, "end": 773.28}, {"text": "Yeah, well...", "start": 773.4, "end": 774.18}, {"text": "That surprises me.", "start": 774.18, "end": 775.4}, {"text": "Well, I think the first time that you see someone, it impresses you some way, and you feel attracted to that person.", "start": 776.66, "end": 782.24}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 782.48, "end": 782.72}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 783.18, "end": 783.6}, {"text": "At least it's the first feeling that you get that makes you want to talk to that person or get to know that person.", "start": 783.6, "end": 789.58}, {"text": "I am the exact opposite.", "start": 789.74, "end": 791.04}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 791.42, "end": 791.84}, {"text": "When I see somebody for the first time, my first impression is always wrong.", "start": 792.1, "end": 797.06}, {"text": "Ah, okay.", "start": 797.32, "end": 798.12}, {"text": "So if I see someone and I like them at the beginning, in three weeks I'll hate them.", "start": 798.12, "end": 803.18}, {"text": "And if I see someone and I don't like them when I first meet them, I'll be their best friend.", "start": 803.36, "end": 808.04}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 808.26, "end": 808.88}, {"text": "So love at first sight doesn't work for me.", "start": 809.02, "end": 810.96}, {"text": "I'm sure that our listeners have some stories at love at first sight.", "start": 811.32, "end": 814.1}, {"text": "Maybe they've met their wives or their boyfriends in this way.", "start": 814.24, "end": 817.1}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 817.1, "end": 817.22}, {"text": "I'd like to hear about it.", "start": 817.8, "end": 818.72}, {"text": "Me too.", "start": 818.86, "end": 819.36}, {"text": "And if anybody knows the name of the songs we used, also be sure to post it on the discussion board.", "start": 819.56, "end": 825.3}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 825.48, "end": 826.12}, {"text": "Our challenge for this week.", "start": 826.12, "end": 827.56}, {"text": "Our challenge for this lesson.", "start": 827.56, "end": 829.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 829.74, "end": 829.88}, {"text": "So that's all for today, everyone.", "start": 830.14, "end": 831.68}, {"text": "But be sure to go to our website at englishpot.com.", "start": 831.92, "end": 835.26}, {"text": "And as we said, leave all your comments, your stories, and see if you know the name of the songs.", "start": 835.46, "end": 841.06}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 841.48, "end": 841.96}, {"text": "Well, thanks for listening, everyone.", "start": 842.06, "end": 843.18}, {"text": "And until next time, goodbye.", "start": 843.42, "end": 845.6}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 845.86, "end": 846.06}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 846.6, "end": 847.08}, {"text": "", "start": 847.1, "end": 847.1}]